        {
          "number": 2,
          "x": 0.7652284263959391,
          "y": 0.5272079649815467,
          "sourceText": "\"Course Notice and Risk Warning:\n\nThe SPAX running course, including all courses within the SPAX App (hereinafter referred to as \"Courses\"), is a product developed and operated by SPAX and its affiliates. The ownership and intellectual property rights of the Courses belong to SPAX and its affiliated companies. Exercise carries certain risks, and before starting the Courses, you should take a responsible attitude towards yourself and take reasonable precautions and assess your own capabilities. You should also confirm that you have carefully read and accepted this \"Course Notice and Risk Warning\".\n\nThis notice applies to all SPAX users.\n\nThe following groups are not suitable for participating in the Courses: teenagers under 16 years old, elderly people over 60 years old, those who are preparing for pregnancy, pregnant women and mothers within one year of breastfeeding, those who have undergone surgery within 6 months or major surgery within one year, individuals with diabetes, gout, severe metabolic diseases, cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases, lung diseases, orthopedic injuries, spinal diseases, joint injuries, and other individuals who have been advised by a doctor not to exercise.\n\nBefore participating in the Courses, you should go to a medical institution for a physical examination and consult a doctor about your physical condition to ensure that you have the physical condition to participate in the Courses.\n\nBefore and after participating in the Courses, please do not consume alcoholic beverages or any stimulants prohibited by national laws and regulations.\n\nIf you have any physical conditions that may affect or may be affected during the Courses, or if you feel any discomfort during the Courses, please stop immediately.\n\nIf you ignore the above notice but still insist on participating in the Courses, you will bear all risks, damages, and liabilities, and SPAX will not assume any legal responsibility or any compensation or reimbursement arising therefrom.\n\nIf you have any questions about equipment use or course content, please carefully read the relevant equipment instructions or course action guidelines to avoid the risk of injury. After participating in the Courses, please start slowly and progress gradually.\n\nDue to differences in personal physique, basic forms, and exercise abilities, SPAX cannot guarantee that all users will achieve a certain desired fitness effect.\n\nEntering the training means that you have fully understood all the risks, damages, and liabilities that may arise from participating in the training courses, and voluntarily assume such risks and liabilities.\"",
          "translation": "",
          "translations": {},
          "androidTranslationId": "spax_warn",
          "iosTranslationId": "",
          "subItems": []
        },
